{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HAQGF0ewGA1795470183.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>黃仁勳復職，道指升逾千四點，晶片商輝達升三成一。</p><p></p><p>【此前報道】</p><p></p><p>輝達公布黃仁勳復職後股價急升，美國股市亦顯著回升，三大指數早段急漲百分之2至7。</p><p></p><p>美國晶片商輝達董事會重新任命黃仁勳為行政總裁。輝達早段曾經急升逾三成，升至167美元水平。</p><p></p><p>黃仁勳承認婚外情後，輝達股價急挫，截至上周五，累積跌幅近三成三。</p><p></p><p>美股周一投資氣氛有改善，道指曾升約1,300點。</p><p></p><p>納斯達克指數高開逾1,600點，升幅逾百分之7，重回24,200點水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T22:36:52.323183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T21:42:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T22:30:13.129530+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T22:30:13.129530+00:00","content_hash":"dbd3bf5a0423adb9a4c721d3961b500bf4f2e2b361467a1840ed16d9745d7eaf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}